  planner_response {
    response: "**Yes, you can integrate this journal directly with a Notion Database using the Notion API.**\n\nHere is how it works and what would be involved:\n\n---\n\n### How Notion Database Integration Works\n\n1. **Notion Integration & API Key**:\n   - In Notion (via [notion.so/my-integrations](https://www.notion.so/my-integrations)), you create an internal integration to generate a **Notion Internal Integration Secret / Token** (`secret_...`).\n   - You grant the integration access to your Notion workspace and your specific Trading Journal Database page.\n\n2. **Database Property Mapping**:\n   Your Notion Database columns map directly to the trading journal fields:\n   - **Pair / Instrument** (Title or Select: `EUR/USD`, `XAU/USD`, etc.)\n   - **Direction** (Select: `LONG` / `SHORT`)\n   - **Strategy Setup** (Select: `DEMAND`, `SUPPLY`, `T.C QML`, `T.C. QML A+`, `DB`, `DT`, etc.)\n   - **Entry / Exit / Stop Loss** (Numbers)\n   - **PnL / Return %** (Numbers or Formulas)\n   - **Status** (Select: `WIN`, `LOSS`, `BREAKEVEN`, `OPEN`)\n   - **Screenshot URL** (Files & Media or URL property)\n   - **Notes / Execution Review** (Rich Text or Page Content)\n\n3. **Backend Proxy (`server.ts`)**:\n   - The app\'s Express backend uses the official `@notionhq/client` SDK.\n   - Endpoints are created for:\n     - `GET /api/notion/trades` (queries your Notion database to load trades into the app)\n     - `POST /api/notion/trades` (creates a new page/entry in your Notion database when you submit a trade)\n     - `PATCH /api/notion/trades/:id` (updates existing entries in Notion)\n     - `DELETE /api/notion/trades/:id` (archives/deletes entries in Notion)\n\n---\n\n### Key Advantages of Using Notion as your Database\n- **Two-Way Visibility**: You can view, filter, and edit your trades directly in Notion or inside this interactive app with charts, risk calculators, and AI insights.\n- **Rich Media & Notes**: Easily attach full TradingView chart screenshots, checklists, and rich markdown directly to your Notion pages.\n- **No SQL Database Setup Required**: You own all your data inside your personal Notion workspace without managing external databases.\n\n---\n\nWould you like me to implement the Notion integration for this journal?"
    modified_response: "**Yes, you can integrate this journal directly with a Notion Database using the Notion API.**\n\nHere is how it works and what would be involved:\n\n---\n\n### How Notion Database Integration Works\n\n1. **Notion Integration & API Key**:\n   - In Notion (via [notion.so/my-integrations](https://www.notion.so/my-integrations)), you create an internal integration to generate a **Notion Internal Integration Secret / Token** (`secret_...`).\n   - You grant the integration access to your Notion workspace and your specific Trading Journal Database page.\n\n2. **Database Property Mapping**:\n   Your Notion Database columns map directly to the trading journal fields:\n   - **Pair / Instrument** (Title or Select: `EUR/USD`, `XAU/USD`, etc.)\n   - **Direction** (Select: `LONG` / `SHORT`)\n   - **Strategy Setup** (Select: `DEMAND`, `SUPPLY`, `T.C QML`, `T.C. QML A+`, `DB`, `DT`, etc.)\n   - **Entry / Exit / Stop Loss** (Numbers)\n   - **PnL / Return %** (Numbers or Formulas)\n   - **Status** (Select: `WIN`, `LOSS`, `BREAKEVEN`, `OPEN`)\n   - **Screenshot URL** (Files & Media or URL property)\n   - **Notes / Execution Review** (Rich Text or Page Content)\n\n3. **Backend Proxy (`server.ts`)**:\n   - The app\'s Express backend uses the official `@notionhq/client` SDK.\n   - Endpoints are created for:\n     - `GET /api/notion/trades` (queries your Notion database to load trades into the app)\n     - `POST /api/notion/trades` (creates a new page/entry in your Notion database when you submit a trade)\n     - `PATCH /api/notion/trades/:id` (updates existing entries in Notion)\n     - `DELETE /api/notion/trades/:id` (archives/deletes entries in Notion)\n\n---\n\n### Key Advantages of Using Notion as your Database\n- **Two-Way Visibility**: You can view, filter, and edit your trades directly in Notion or inside this interactive app with charts, risk calculators, and AI insights.\n- **Rich Media & Notes**: Easily attach full TradingView chart screenshots, checklists, and rich markdown directly to your Notion pages.\n- **No SQL Database Setup Required**: You own all your data inside your personal Notion workspace without managing external databases.\n\n---\n\nWould you like me to implement the Notion integration for this journal?"
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
