  planner_response {
    response: "**Yes, you can use Notion ONLY and completely remove or bypass Supabase.**\n\nHere is the direct answer to your questions:\n\n### 1. Will Supabase be affected?\n- **No.** Supabase will not be affected at all. \n- We can completely disconnect and remove Supabase from the project so the application only talks directly to your Notion Database.\n\n### 2. Can you use Notion Database ONLY?\n- **Yes!** When you log, edit, or delete a trade in the app:\n  1. It writes directly to your **Notion Database** page.\n  2. When you open the app, it fetches all your trades directly from **Notion**.\n  3. Your analytics, win rate charts, risk calculator, and AI advisor will read from your **Notion Database**.\n  4. You won\'t need Supabase at all.\n\n---\n\n### What is needed to connect Notion:\n1. **`NOTION_API_KEY`** (Integration token from [notion.so/my-integrations](https://www.notion.so/my-integrations))\n2. **`NOTION_DATABASE_ID`** (The 32-character ID from your Notion trading journal database URL)\n\n---\n\nWould you like me to switch the app to **Notion Database Only** and set up the integration right now?"
    modified_response: "**Yes, you can use Notion ONLY and completely remove or bypass Supabase.**\n\nHere is the direct answer to your questions:\n\n### 1. Will Supabase be affected?\n- **No.** Supabase will not be affected at all. \n- We can completely disconnect and remove Supabase from the project so the application only talks directly to your Notion Database.\n\n### 2. Can you use Notion Database ONLY?\n- **Yes!** When you log, edit, or delete a trade in the app:\n  1. It writes directly to your **Notion Database** page.\n  2. When you open the app, it fetches all your trades directly from **Notion**.\n  3. Your analytics, win rate charts, risk calculator, and AI advisor will read from your **Notion Database**.\n  4. You won\'t need Supabase at all.\n\n---\n\n### What is needed to connect Notion:\n1. **`NOTION_API_KEY`** (Integration token from [notion.so/my-integrations](https://www.notion.so/my-integrations))\n2. **`NOTION_DATABASE_ID`** (The 32-character ID from your Notion trading journal database URL)\n\n---\n\nWould you like me to switch the app to **Notion Database Only** and set up the integration right now?"
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
